{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Welcome to Space </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Defender</strong> is a 2D arcade space shooter blending twin-stick action with RPG progression. Crafted by a solo French developer, this dynamic cosmic adventure is playable in English or French with <i>full controller support</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/ExploreSpace.gif?t=1746639710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and Fight Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Journey through <strong>three unique galaxies</strong>, each with polished visuals and escalating challenges. Your ship evolves, but so do your foes! Take on <strong>missions</strong> at stations: wipe out enemy squadrons, defend outposts, or escort vulnerable ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Repel the Threat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle Drones wreaking havoc across sectors. Wield a <strong>diverse arsenal</strong> \u2013 laser cannons, guided missiles, automated turrets, and more \u2013 to prevail. Pilot with precision, as every equipped item affects visuals and gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/Fight.gif?t=1746639710\" />Level Up Your Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn credits from missions to <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> or purchase stronger models, like the <i>Orion Cruiser</i> or <i>Vulture Frigate</i>. Equip over <strong>50 items</strong> (Cobra batteries, Hornet shields) and <strong>manage energy</strong> to optimize performance. Liberate each galaxy by aiding stations, building toward an epic final mission <i>(coming soon</i><strong>\u2122</strong><i>)</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/Travel.gif?t=1746639710\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access: Join the Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Early Access, Space Defender offers many hours of gameplay but includes some bugs (UI, missions) and repetitive tasks we\u2019re refining. New missions (massive battles, swarm) and a polished experience are planned for the full release. Commander, <i>your feedback will shape this universe</i> \u2013 <strong>jump in now!</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1731170?t=1746639710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746639710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746639710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746639710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Welcome to Space </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Defender</strong> is a 2D arcade space shooter blending twin-stick action with RPG progression. Crafted by a solo French developer, this dynamic cosmic adventure is playable in English or French with <i>full controller support</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/ExploreSpace.gif?t=1746639710\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore and Fight Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Journey through <strong>three unique galaxies</strong>, each with polished visuals and escalating challenges. Your ship evolves, but so do your foes! Take on <strong>missions</strong> at stations: wipe out enemy squadrons, defend outposts, or escort vulnerable ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Repel the Threat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Battle Drones wreaking havoc across sectors. Wield a <strong>diverse arsenal</strong> \u2013 laser cannons, guided missiles, automated turrets, and more \u2013 to prevail. Pilot with precision, as every equipped item affects visuals and gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/Fight.gif?t=1746639710\" />Level Up Your Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Earn credits from missions to <strong>upgrade your ship</strong> or purchase stronger models, like the <i>Orion Cruiser</i> or <i>Vulture Frigate</i>. Equip over <strong>50 items</strong> (Cobra batteries, Hornet shields) and <strong>manage energy</strong> to optimize performance. Liberate each galaxy by aiding stations, building toward an epic final mission <i>(coming soon</i><strong>\u2122</strong><i>)</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/extras/Travel.gif?t=1746639710\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access: Join the Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Early Access, Space Defender offers many hours of gameplay but includes some bugs (UI, missions) and repetitive tasks we\u2019re refining. New missions (massive battles, swarm) and a polished experience are planned for the full release. Commander, <i>your feedback will shape this universe</i> \u2013 <strong>jump in now!</strong> </p>","developers":["Guillaume M92"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1731170/fea4f207de6e1f8649a8288fc62c76596a67acf6/header.jpg?t=1746639710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256847969,"mp4":{"480":"htt